From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mpc823 <11076149+mpc823@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] common: show Neutrino Fusion splash with legacy fallback

Use the common logo directory for the project splash on every target. Older
images that do not contain the new asset retain the existing logo behaviour.
The decision is made at runtime and is independent of tuner or platform
selection.
---
 src/neutrino.cpp | 6 +++++-
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/neutrino.cpp b/src/neutrino.cpp
index 0000000..1111111 100644
--- a/src/neutrino.cpp
+++ b/src/neutrino.cpp
@@ -2354,1 +2354,5 @@
-	frameBuffer->showFrame(LOGODIR "/logo.jpg");
+	const char *fusionSplash = LOGODIR "/neutrino-fusion-splash.png";
+	if (access(fusionSplash, R_OK) == 0)
+		frameBuffer->showFrame(fusionSplash);
+	else
+		frameBuffer->showFrame(LOGODIR "/logo.jpg");
